I'm gathering key changes including new DTOs like VariantMatrixResponse, the addition of ProductCollection entity for filtering, updates to multiple resource tests, and OpenAPI spec extensions at specific lines. I'll also cover executed lint and test commands, Quarkus spec regeneration, feature flag cleanup, and the `.codemachine` task update to present a clear, bullet-pointed summary with file references and verification steps.
[RUNNING]● Message: **Key Updates**
- Catalog listing now enforces feature flags and applies category/collection filters via the new `CatalogService.listProducts(...)` flow and repository queries (`modules/core-platform/src/main/java/villagecompute/storefront/api/rest/ProductResource.java:96`, `modules/core-platform/src/main/java/villagecompute/storefront/services/CatalogService.java:216`, `modules/core-platform/src/main/java/villagecompute/storefront/data/repositories/ProductRepository.java:33`). A new `ProductCollection` join entity underpins collection filtering (`modules/core-platform/src/main/java/villagecompute/storefront/data/models/ProductCollection.java:1`).
- Added the `GET /api/v1/catalog/products/{productId}/variant-matrix` endpoint with DTOs that emit option axes/variant rows while honoring the `catalog.variant-matrix.enabled` flag (`ProductResource.java:200`, `modules/core-platform/src/main/java/villagecompute/storefront/api/types/VariantMatrixResponse.java:1`, `VariantMatrixEntry.java:1`, `VariantOptionAxis.java:1`).
- Catalog admin endpoints gained parent validation and ProblemDetails responses, reflected in both implementation and spec (`modules/core-platform/src/main/java/villagecompute/storefront/api/rest/CatalogAdminResource.java:118`, `api/v1/openapi.yaml:461`).
- The OpenAPI contract now documents Catalog/Inventory tags, collection/category schemas, shared rate-limit headers, and the variant matrix path (`api/v1/openapi.yaml:305`, `461`, `512`, `719`, `3405`). Regenerated Quarkus artifacts in `modules/core-platform/api/v1/openapi.{json,yaml}` to stay in sync.
- ProductResource integration tests seed flags/categories/collections and verify filtering + variant matrix + 403 behavior (`modules/core-platform/src/test/java/villagecompute/storefront/api/rest/ProductResourceTest.java:302`, `314`, `387`). Related suites gained cleanup for new tables/feature flags (`ConsignmentResourceTest.java:58`, `HealthResourceTest.java:33`, `CatalogValidatorTest.java:281`, `CollectionRepositoryTest.java:282`, `CatalogServiceTest.java:398`, `VendorPortalResourceTest.java:42`).
